#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:5 4a61f051e71b4116a2f623a8983156fc
msgid "How to Edit Someone Else's PR Directly"
msgstr "如何直接编辑他人的 PR"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:7 c3036a7df3c94cdd82ad6beb55ecda81
msgid ""
"Occasionally, it is desirable to make some small changes to someone else's "
"submitted PR in order to facilitate its readiness for merging. This "
"describes one procedure for doing this."
msgstr "有时需要对他人提交的 PR 进行一些小改动，以便使其可以合并。本文描述了一种完成此操作的流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:10 167f3eb3597047bab15951b655359626
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:12 d1d293e9ade5477ca99c9de80fe210f4
msgid ""
"It is assumed that you have worked on the GitHub repository for ArduPilot "
"before and have cloned a fork of the repository locally."
msgstr "假设您之前已经在 GitHub 上操作过 ArduPilot 的仓库，并且已在本地克隆了该仓库的 fork。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:15 c3b1e66b29d6485a8532aee4b4ce6038
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "操作流程"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:17 125f6efe94214b5e8f7a4b39116e6418
msgid ""
"First, determine if you have been given permission to modify the PR. If so, "
"then at the bottom of the PR on GitHub.com you will see :"
msgstr "首先，确认您是否已获得修改该 PR 的权限。如果是，在 GitHub.com 上该 PR 的底部您将看到："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:19 65c2c09045de4f5bb980ee6638128da4
msgid ""
"\"Add more commits by pushing to the ``xyz`` branch on "
"``username/ardupilot``\""
msgstr "「通过推送到 ``username/ardupilot`` 上的 ``xyz`` 分支来添加更多提交」"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:21 97d49c00cc4f462a81fa01cfd706f297
msgid ""
"First set up a remote to username's repository, in this case we will call it"
" ``tempremote`` : ::"
msgstr "首先为该用户的仓库设置一个远程地址，此处我们将其命名为 ``tempremote`` ："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:26 b6f7e1f3046a4ee5bf85fe2e6c0fcac3
msgid ""
"this sets up ``tempremote`` to point to the originators repository on "
"GitHub."
msgstr "这将 ``tempremote`` 指向 GitHub 上提交者的仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:28 d4c81f761d90459ab752710ed975914a
msgid ""
"To pull the PR branch ``xyz`` down to your local computer's repository in "
"order to modify it:"
msgstr "将 PR 分支 ``xyz`` 拉取到本地仓库以便修改："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:34 9a215f83aa9345f2b1b90cf037795d39
msgid "which will copy the PR's branch into a local buffer."
msgstr "这会将 PR 的分支复制到本地缓冲区。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:36 9ef65260476b4084bd886b399f2e46bd
msgid ""
"Then create a local branch ``username-xyz`` and which is a copy of the PR"
msgstr "然后创建本地分支 ``username-xyz``，即 PR 的副本"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:43 ace13c865cf4437b80f1b5f500aa5fbf
msgid ""
"Next make your mods and commit them with a commit message explaining your "
"changes. This message will actually be removed in the next step, but it's "
"good to make it something meaningful if you need to reset or revert in the "
"future."
msgstr "接下来进行修改，并用提交信息说明您的更改。此提交信息在下一步中实际上会被移除，但如果将来需要重置或回退，最好写一些有意义的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:45 73e070f637954a06a06c6e8425d9b549
msgid ""
"You should also \"squash\" (see :ref:`git-interactive-rebase` ) your commit "
"into the originator's before pushing to his repository yourself. At this "
"point you can use the originator's commit message or change it if it needs. "
"Also, you should be sure that the entire commit conforms to the ArduPilot "
"style guidelines (see :ref:`style-guide` )."
msgstr ""
"在推送到原作者仓库前，您还需要将您的提交「压缩」（参见 :ref:`git-interactive-"
"rebase`）合并到原作者的提交中。此时可以使用原作者的提交信息，或根据需要修改。同时，您应确保整个提交符合 ArduPilot 代码风格指南（参见 "
":ref:`style-guide`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:47 88025e58dbc749fb999e86fd829f5aa6
msgid ""
"Finally, you can force push over the originators PR to include your "
"modifications:"
msgstr "最后，您可以强制推送以覆盖原作者的 PR，将您的修改包含进去："

#: ../../source/docs/editing-prs.rst:53 acd982068702471786eed5296716a81f
msgid ""
"The changes will be reflected in the PR on GitHub. You may now delete your "
"``username-xyz`` branch locally."
msgstr "更改将体现在 GitHub 上的 PR 中。现在您可以在本地删除 ``username-xyz`` 分支。"
